{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 5, :comments [{:quotes [{:he "מזבח לפניו", :translit "mizbe'ach lefanav", :gloss "an altar before Him"} {:he "חור", :translit "Hur", :gloss "Hur"} {:he "מזבוח לפניו", :translit "mizbuah lefanav", :gloss "slaughtered before Him"}], :mechanisms [{:kind :gematria, :a "מזבח לפניו", :b "חור"} {:kind :other, :note "Midrashic repointing of מזבח (altar) as מזבוח (slaughtered), rendering the verse 'slaughtered before Him'"} {:kind :other, :note "Hur, who opposed the Golden Calf, was killed by the mob"}], :frame {:text "When Aaron sought to restrain the Israelites from idolatry, Hur rebuked them and they killed him (Tanchuma, Tetzaveh 10; Pirkei de-Rabbi Eliezer 45). The midrashic reading of 'מזבח לפניו' as 'מזבוח לפניו' — 'slaughtered before Him' — alludes to Hur's murder. The gematria equating 'מזבח לפניו' with 'חור' identifies Hur himself as the one slaughtered before God at the Golden Calf.", :sources ["Tanchuma Tetzaveh 10" "Pirkei de-Rabbi Eliezer 45"]}}], :arithmetic [{:kind :gematria, :a "מזבח לפניו", :a-value 233, :b "חור", :b-value 214, :lens :standard, :by :selah, :equal? false} {:kind :other, :note "Midrashic repointing of מזבח (altar) as מזבוח (slaughtered), rendering the verse 'slaughtered before Him'", :by :selah, :ran? false} {:kind :other, :note "Hur, who opposed the Golden Calf, was killed by the mob", :by :selah, :ran? false}], :book :exodus, :voice :baal-haturim, :lang :en, :chapter 32, :discipline "bht-chalkboard-v1", :timestamp "2026-07-12T23:20:30.202121882Z", :model "glm-5.2"}